!Name: lightspeed
!CThis is a mechanism that could be used for lightspeed
!Ccommunication (note the lone glider in the pattern on the
!Cleft). The only catch is that we need a way to create long
!Cwavesof closely spaced gliders. This can be done by using
!Cmany edge-shooting glider guns, but it requires a lot of
!Cspace. The completed device would be shaped like a very
!Celongated diamond, with lightspeed communication
!Coccurring across the short diagonal.
!CJason Summers, 29 Oct 1999
